Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:06.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　源源不绝的热情{\fad(500,00)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:12.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着怦然心动的未来  伸出双手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:18.35,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够放出光芒　IT'S WONDERLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:24.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未来那无法预测的黑夜  震撼着你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:31.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法相信任何东西  你充耳不闻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:39.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你相遇的瞬间  我找到了真正的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:48.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不自觉的温柔呈现在面前  把我们唤醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:55.32,OP2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　不会再迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:01:05.06,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要构筑起跟你在一起的未来  就能飞向任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:10.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,CHANGE MY MIND　源源不绝的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:15.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着未知的明天  张开双翼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:22.06,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够展翅飞翔　IT'S WONDERLAND{\fad(0000,480)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.36,0:22:17.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们 在生命的旅程中{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.40,0:22:23.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渐渐地 失去所有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:29.72,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:36.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:46.93,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今在那深深的丛林中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.23,0:22:52.74,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也一定埋藏着 被丢弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.07,0:22:59.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若能把握时光的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:05.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许 能再次飞翔{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:14.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将彷徨着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.69,0:23:20.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生存下去 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.79,0:23:26.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:33.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能捡回一条命就算万幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我们还是比较适合拿锄头而不是刀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为我要没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下就能活着回村子了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这多亏了那位巫女大人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太走运了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与平他醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.73,0:01:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要振作点啊 与平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女大人的药果然有效
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与平醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿鬼还在觊觎这个男人的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女大人 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 他已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概明天就能起来走动了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫桔梗的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在这座寺里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你对在战争中受伤的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:02:48.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是我方或敌营的人 都会帮他们疗伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还用神奇的法术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇迹般救活很多生命垂危的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是什么神奇的法术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是对治疗伤口有点心得罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:02:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有话到城堡里再说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:01.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陷入邪气中的桔梗与犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们人见家的主公 荫刀大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生来就体弱多病
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久前先主去世
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由他继承了城主之位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他的身体最近越来越差
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管如此 别说医师了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他连家臣都不被允许靠近半步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以 谁都不能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把能够治好荫刀大人的巫女带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是主公说不准任何人进去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公不愿意见任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座城堡是怎么回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股邪气是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂…喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个男人发出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:03:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从他的身上完全感觉不到生气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:02.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像除了头以外都死了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公 实在是很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人不顾我们阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.91,0:04:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说能够治愈疾病 就擅自闯入
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都退下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗还活着…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50年前 被我设计害死的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本应带着四魂之玉死去的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人…到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事？这可太惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边也不行 全部都枯了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:04:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又没有遇上干旱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.89,0:05:03.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一个月突然全枯了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像血一样鲜红
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们说妖怪的残骸从天而降啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 看起来真的好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田地全都被污染了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是田地而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老人和小孩这些体弱的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个接一个倒下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近一定有一个强烈邪气的源头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 又要帮人家除妖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这么有空去干这些吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得快点去找奈落 找奈落啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你道歉 我也绝对不会原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提到奈落那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他上次中戈薇的那一箭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该已经受了很重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是以奈落的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,短时间之内
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他恐怕是无法复原的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们连谢礼钱都收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.10,0:06:22.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下非得帮人家不可了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时侯收的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.97,0:06:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 谁叫你收的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是要收礼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也应该做完事再收才对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后才收的话都不会给多的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小子…势利眼臭和尚！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来邪气的源头无疑就是那座山了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得除了奈落没有妖怪能放出这么强的邪气了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了奈落…是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:07:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家主公的病情如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 恐怕连我也束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我知道主公的病情不轻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到连你都束手无策啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一个平凡的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在抱歉 我就此告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公命令我们不能让你离开城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就暂时留在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本应死去的桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要杀她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待查清她底细之后也不迟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今夜我终于如愿以偿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到了一个有趣的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为瘴气的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里根本寸草不生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:55.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座山里到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这山洞怎么回事？邪气从是从洞里出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:11.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体还没有完全康复
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚和戈薇在这里等着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是除妖而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要大家一起进去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 好像你没什么大碍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好小心一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.07,0:08:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股邪气十分强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉到了 巨大的邪气之穴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把门打开 然后把弓箭找来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你要不要紧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘴气好像越来越强了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 戈薇你竟然一点事都没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 暂时还好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事…好像有东西想把我吸进去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:25.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个洞穴里到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉跟弥勒大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.99,0:09:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气越来越强了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你干什么 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是久经修行才只是如此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换成普通人类 早就没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪的…残骸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.06,0:10:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些妖怪缠斗在一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有上百只妖怪在这里厮杀过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,落在那村子里的一定就是这里的残骸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:11:01.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们为什么要这么做…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后剩下的那只妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体融合在一起了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我出不去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是只有最后获胜的妖怪才能活着离开这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来那里还有一只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我猜得没错的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样下去不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子就陪你打个爽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你不能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以你现在的身体 要是进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会撑不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你还是先离开这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再待在这里的话 对你的身体很不好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉在里面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…戈薇 那个巫女就是桔梗对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:50.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要追过去吗？戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝你陪在珊瑚身边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 刚才那个人是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道为什么桔梗会到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过里面肯定发生了不好的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.67,0:13:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带云母去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身体里的死魂想冲出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.85,0:13:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被这洞穴中的邪气所吸引吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气之外还能感觉到一股气息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股气息是…城里那个男人的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.24,0:13:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就要了断你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这家伙的伤复原了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快把刀收起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要跟它战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不战斗难道要我坐以待毙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:57.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听我说 这是所谓的“巫蛊之术”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.99,0:13:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟“蛊毒”的作法是一模一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“巫蛊之术”？“蛊毒”？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所谓的“巫蛊之术”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:09.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是把毒虫 蜥蜴之类的放在一个容器中互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后活下来的一只就成为“蛊毒”的咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在说这些也没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:27.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能活着离开这里的只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能跟它拼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么下去就不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不把这里的咒术解除的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉就会…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:14:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔…桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死魂…在流走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗…这股邪气是…“蛊毒”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被我的咒术封在山洞中的无数妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在里面互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.21,0:15:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,获胜存活的最后一只
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它才会…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为我奈落新的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.41,0:16:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？四魂的气息…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这块四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是另外一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外一个拥有 四魂碎片的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为吸收了桔梗的死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.17,0:16:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的邪气越来越强了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒大人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 你振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:02.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒大人 这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方被施了“巫蛊之术”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赶快阻止犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样下去他会跟妖怪融合的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:17.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,融合？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到四魂碎片的气息了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…这是圈套？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这邪气的强度 应该没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.43,0:17:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奈落设下的圈套
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为我的血肉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你…碰桔梗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要太激动 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能不激动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑 我一定要保护桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要保护桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.68,0:18:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇小姐 你要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把桔梗的身体拉上来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会为了保护桔梗而继续战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:30.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉绝对无法坐视桔梗不管
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:32.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我有点不甘心…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了？站得起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.81,0:18:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:46.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你跑进来 犬夜叉完全失去了理智
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.99,0:18:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是为了救你才这么拼命的 你却…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.53,0:19:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要杀它啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.14,0:19:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印解除了 邪气开始往外面冲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是桔梗她…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被戈薇打碎的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落为了制造新的身躯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用了“巫蛊之术”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们似乎被山里的邪气所吸引
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闯入了我封印的洞穴中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:51.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也可以成为我身体的一部分的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.19,0:20:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个女人把封印解除了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过托她的福我能顺利取得新的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗之所以会破坏封印
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是因为她要保护犬夜叉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.11,0:21:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是50年前追随你死去的桔梗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿开你的脏手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不准你碰桔梗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.66,0:21:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,畜牲…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,畜牲！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.38,0:21:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果桔梗真的想救犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其破坏封印
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如用箭射穿妖怪“蛊毒”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗却破坏了封印
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.69,0:22:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我奈落得到了全新的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落得到了全新的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.55,0:23:54.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更加强大的妖力袭向了我们心中的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,思念着桔梗的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.69,0:23:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受风穴之苦的弥勒大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.59,0:24:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为弟弟琥珀的幻影而彷徨的珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.80,0:24:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你愿意帮我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.97,0:24:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们收集到现在的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.94,0:24:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要那些碎片想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.57,0:24:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.97,0:24:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被囚禁的桔梗与奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.11,0:24:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.78,0:25:19.88,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫蛊之术中最后残存的妖怪{\pos(292,288)}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.78,0:25:19.88,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被奈落用来制造新的身躯{\pos(283,414)}
